    "description": "This version supersedes GRID3 NGA - Settlement Extents v3.1. The following changes were made: Creation of blocks in urban and semi-urban areas; and Removal of falsely detected settlements identified during fieldwork For more information on the methodology and data sources used during the production of these data, click here.",
